# Allowlist: the image build (docker/Dockerfile) copies the whole context, so
# everything not needed by `cargo build --release` stays out. This keeps local
# benchmark results, traces, agent state and env files out of the image layers.
*

!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!build.rs
!src/
!bpf/
!bench/
!tests/

# Re-excluded inside the allowlisted trees (last matching rule wins).
**/target/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.o
**/*.skel.rs
**/*.tmp.bpf.o
**/.DS_Store
